OL,3,GNEWSAHousing loans granted while
OL,4,ABurnham was mayor investigated by
OL,5,Acouncillors
OL,6,
OL,7,FLoans made to property companies -
OL,8,Fincluding three controlled by
OL,9,FManchester City's Abu Dhabi owner -
OL,10,Fwhile Andy Burnham was Greater
OL,11,FManchester mayor are being investigated
OL,12,Fby councillors.
OL,14,FAbout 50 developers have been lent more
OL,15,Fthan #1bn between them from a fund
OL,16,Fmanaged by the Greater Manchester
OL,17,FCombined Authority (GMCA) since 2015.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
