OL,3,GNEWSAHousing loans granted while
OL,4,ABurnham was mayor investigated by
OL,5,Acouncillors
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Leech, the chairman of the GMCA's
OL,8,FOverview and Scrutiny Committee, told
OL,9,Fthe BBC concerns had been raised about
OL,10,Fthe transparency of the process to
OL,11,Fapprove the loans.
OL,13,F"We just want to be clear that there is
OL,14,Fa transparent rather than an opaque
OL,15,Fprocess," said Leech, who is the
OL,16,FLiberal Democrat opposition leader on
OL,17,FManchester City Council.
